    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.poster.avif?t=1753466616\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.webm?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.mp4?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Build a unique team, craft strategic decks, and conquer tactical battles in this challenging medieval fantasy roguelike. Every decision matters: choose your heroes, position them wisely, and master the art of war to overcome ever-growing challenges.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7d055085dcb4abf671fbe37e2669ee01.avif?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=174 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c3788e3b1d3bc81b10c61c3864f98c94.poster.avif?t=1753466616\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c3788e3b1d3bc81b10c61c3864f98c94.webm?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c3788e3b1d3bc81b10c61c3864f98c94.mp4?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Every run is a new experience! Select and combine heroes with unique abilities, forming teams that complement each other. There are no perfect teams, only well-planned strategies. Anticipate challenges, create synergies, and discover new ways to break the game in your favor.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7d055085dcb4abf671fbe37e2669ee01.avif?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Adapt your strategy every match! Build unique decks for each hero and make crucial decisions with every card you acquire. Since cards are discarded after use, planning your selection wisely can be the key to victory or defeat.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/1ab7474037e13deb2d085955d912d376.poster.avif?t=1753466616\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/1ab7474037e13deb2d085955d912d376.webm?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/1ab7474037e13deb2d085955d912d376.mp4?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/8350daf5b34a6df4132e6b3ed0dc4223.avif?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Strategic tile-based battles require precise positioning and quick thinking. Take advantage of the terrain, protect allies, and exploit enemy weaknesses. Every move can be decisive, and mastering the combat space is essential to maximizing your team\u2019s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/199b46172ffac3bbafd4db7a6da5de78.poster.avif?t=1753466616\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/199b46172ffac3bbafd4db7a6da5de78.webm?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/199b46172ffac3bbafd4db7a6da5de78.mp4?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Timing is everything! Know when to attack, when to hold your cards, and when to expand your action points. Plan your turns carefully to balance risk and reward, ensuring your team grows stronger without being overwhelmed by enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide range of enemies, each with unique strategies! Powerful dragons, relentless orc hordes, cunning demons, impenetrable golems, and undead legions will test your tactics. Choose your team wisely and adapt to every challenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.poster.avif?t=1753466616\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.webm?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/faa913ca75d081295d530b4555db53c4.mp4?t=1753466616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span>Build a unique team, craft strategic decks, and conquer tactical battles in this challenging medieval fantasy roguelike. Every decision matters: choose your heroes, position them wisely, and master the art of war to overcome ever-growing challenges.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1753466616\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7d05